<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2YOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili lwa ikabili lwa Yohana lwandikigwa na Mtumigwa wa Kilisto Yohana mmilao ya 90 songela kuvumbuka kwa Kilisto. Yohana haitambule mwenyego kamba heyo iyo yandike ulupwilili, ila heyo koikema mwenyego kamba m'vyele. Mbuli zili mulupwilili lwa Yohana wa ikabili zilinga ng'hani na mbuli zili Muusenga Unogile wa Yohana hasa ahaja voyogong'ondeza ndagizi ya Yesu ya kuinogela wenyego kwa wenyego ahaja hayailingile mbuli ya kumnogela Yesu na mbuli ya kuzigoga ndagizi zake (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:5-6">1:5-6</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 15:9-10">YOHANA 15:9-10</ref></char>). Yokoneka kamba Yohana kandika Usenga Unogile wa Yohana na zimhwilili ndatu za 1Yohana, 2Yohana, na 3Yohana kipigiti viyakalile yokala Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili luno Yohana kamwandikila mtwanzi yasaguligwe hamoja na wanage. Yohana kakala kamba munhu yowandikila wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, na kilamso cha Yohana kwandika lupwilili luno kikala kuwagangamiza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na kuwazuma wanhu waiteganye na wakulufunzi wa uvwizi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yohana kolutambuza lupwilili lwake mkumulonga iyamwandikile lupwilili luja na mkuwalamsa waja iyawandikile (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Kowagangamiza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na kuwakumbusa lagizo kulu kubanza gose (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">1:4-6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kowazuma wanhu wamtogole Kilisto waiteganye na wakulufunzi wa uvwizi (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">1:7-11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Yohana komambukiza lupwilili lwake mkuwagwelela ndamsa kulawa ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa kuja kuyakalile yokala heyo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">1:12-13</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Yohana, m'vyele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">m'vyele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mkulu wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="2JN 1:1">Nomwandikila mtwanzi yasaguligwe na Mulungu hamoja na wanage,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mtwanzi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, na </char><char style="fk" closed="false">wanage </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">madale ga mmambwegambwega gasongezwe na dale dino.</char></note> awo iniwanogele kwelikweli, na sio nie tu, ila vivija wose woitanga ikweli, <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>sama ya kweli ikala mgati yetu na yowa na tweye milongo yose.<verse eid="2JN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Ngekewa, bazi, na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata na kulawa ha Yesu Kilisto vowa hamoja na tweye muikweli na mdinoge.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kweli na Noge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Nideng'ha ng'hani viniwavikile wanago wayagwe wotembela muikweli kamba vija Tata viyatulagize. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/>Na sambi, gweye mtwanzi, sikwandikila ndagizi ya sambi, ila ija itukalile nayo songela haichanduso. Na tuinogele. <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Na dino dijo noge, kamba, tolondigwa tukale mkuzigoga ndagizi za Mulungu. Kamba vumuhulike songela haichanduso kamba, muinogele wenyego kwa wenyego.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Wavwizi bwando weza muulumwengu, awo wolema kutogola kamba Yesu Kilisto keza mulukuli. Munhu yoyose yolema kutogola mbuli kamba zino hiyo m'vwizi na m'beza Kilisto. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Teganyeni sambimchase kija kimsang'hanikile, ila m'bokele nhunza yenu yose.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Munhu yoyose yokimbilila kuulongozi na kuleka kukala mmafundo ga Kilisto hali hamoja na Mulungu. Munhu yoyose yokala mmafundo ka hamoja na wose wabili, Tata na Mwana. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Munhu yoyose yeheza kumwenu na kuleka kufundiza mafundo gano, sambimum'bokele ama kumwingiza mzing'anda zenu. <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yom'bokela kosangila msang'hano zake zihile.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Nnago bwando ga kuwandikileni, ila silonda nyandike na wino mkalatasi, ila nolonda niwatembelele na kulongelela na mweye kihanga kwa kihanga avo deng'ho jetu divikizwe.<verse eid="2JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Wana wa lumbu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wana wa lumbu jenu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">didale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto dikalile kuyakalile Yohana.</char></note> jenu yasaguligwe na Mulungu wowalamsa.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
